@ghalisoftware @Prince_Canuma @0xClandestine @pcuenq @kernelpool @ivanfioravanti a model os a bunch of floating point numbers, also called weights or parameters.

floating point numbers can be encoded in various ways, e.g. 16-bit, 8-bit, 4-bit and variations.

quantization takes the original weights and reencodes that at a lower bit number.

@Its_Nova1012 GPT-5.4 - Best results, highest cost. Well rounded.
